			"notes": "### Changes\n- Updated Gradle (8.14.3), Fabric Loader (0.17.2) and API (0.119.4+1.21.4) and Loom (1.11-SNAPSHOT)\n- Background color of filter entries in config now alternates\n- Increased max filter pattern length to 512 characters\n- Filter config can now be searched for filter patterns\n  - This also allows for validating filter patterns\n- Filter config can now be accessed from main menu through button in chat settings\n\n### Fixes\n- Fixed crash/disconnect when evaluating invalid RegEx pattern\n- Fixed crash in filter config when first clicking on a filter entry and then navigating using the arrow keys\n\n### Known Limitations\n- Filters are active globally and not on a per server basis"
